        {
          "path": "onnx/MODIFIED.txt",
          "byteCount": 876,
          "sha256": "c909635a97090f19fa5ce22742edd9ac467d7c34da76df90fd41b5b5e57e8ee8",
          "content": "Notice of modification (BigScience Open RAIL-M, paragraph 4(c))\n\nThe files duration_predictor.onnx, text_encoder.onnx, vector_estimator.onnx\nand vocoder.onnx in this folder are modified derivatives of Supertone's\nSupertonic 3 model (https://huggingface.co/Supertone/supertonic-3, revision\n3cadd1ee6394adea1bd021217a0e650ede09a323).\n\nThey were changed as follows:\n1. The k2-fsa sherpa-onnx project quantized Supertone's public ONNX graphs to\n   INT8 (archive sherpa-onnx-supertonic-3-tts-int8-2026-05-11.tar.bz2).\n2. Spoken Margins renamed the quantized graph files to match the official\n   Supertonic Swift runtime and packaged them with the official configuration,\n   Unicode index and preset voice styles, which are unchanged.\n\nThe model remains licensed under BigScience Open RAIL-M; see\n../licenses/SUPERTONIC_MODEL_OPENRAIL-M.txt and ../licenses/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.\n"
        },
